			<rms:rms_education_count>2</rms:rms_education_count>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_company>Reyada Accounting Co.</rms:rms_experience_0_company>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>January 2025</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBegin>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>1735689600</rms:rms_experience_0_dateBeginTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>April 2025</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEnd>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEndFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_dateEndTS>1743465600</rms:rms_experience_0_dateEndTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_description>Extracted, analyzed, and tested client financial data using various sampling techniques to ensure accurate audit procedures aligned with the relevant accounting standard.&#xA;Verified account balances by examining contracts, invoices, and third-party confirmations from banks, government agencies, and independent stakeholders.&#xA;Prepared detailed auditing files, contributed to audited financial statement preparation, and performed financial analysis primarily using Excel.&#xA;Managed audit documentation, planned audit activities, and securely stored completed files using 1Audit, while coordinating with clients to gather required information and resolve queries.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_location>Riyadh, Ar-Riyadh, Saudi Arabia</rms:rms_experience_0_location>
			<rms:rms_experience_0_role>Audit Associate (Full-time)</rms:rms_experience_0_role>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_company>Dahna Al Jazirah Co.</rms:rms_experience_1_company>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>January 2022</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBegin>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>1640995200</rms:rms_experience_1_dateBeginTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>December 2024</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEnd>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>1733011200</rms:rms_experience_1_dateEndTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_description>Examined and verified financial documents including invoices, credit notes, and contracts to ensure accuracy and compliance.&#xA;Assisted in the preparation and reconciliation of financial statements and General Ledger accounts.&#xA;Supported accounts payable and receivable processes to maintain accurate and timely financial records.&#xA;Collaborated with cross-functional teams to improve procurement workflows and contributed to financial reporting and budgeting.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_1_isCurrent>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_location>Riyadh, Ar-Riyadh, Saudi Arabia</rms:rms_experience_1_location>
			<rms:rms_experience_1_role>Associate, Finance and Administration Division (Full-time)</rms:rms_experience_1_role>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_company>International Development Research Centre (IDRC)</rms:rms_experience_2_company>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>January 2020</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBegin>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>1577836800</rms:rms_experience_2_dateBeginTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>October 2020</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEnd>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndFormat>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>1601510400</rms:rms_experience_2_dateEndTS>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_description>Communicated effectively with vendors to obtain information before the payment date.&#xA;Assisted the Chief Accountant of Operations with central and regional office transactions.&#xA;Prepared various accounting activities using MS Excel and MS DYNAMICS NAV.&#xA;Performed weekly activities such as analyzing and updating weekly FX rates, verifying bank charges, organizing files, and improving outdated training guides.</rms:rms_experience_2_description>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_2_isCurrent>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_location>Ottawa, Ontario, Canada</rms:rms_experience_2_location>
			<rms:rms_experience_2_role>Corporate Accountant (Co-op Program)</rms:rms_experience_2_role>
			<rms:rms_experience_count>3</rms:rms_experience_count>
			<rms:rms_involvement_count>0</rms:rms_involvement_count>
			<rms:rms_project_count>0</rms:rms_project_count>
			<rms:rms_publication_count>0</rms:rms_publication_count>
			<rms:rms_reference_count>0</rms:rms_reference_count>
